            "review_title": "Review at Soi Do - Pizza & Pasta - 144 Pho Duc Chinh",
            "review_text": "jjsweeter\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n2\nBad food, terrible service\nSep 2018\nI am truly shocked at my experience with Soi Do\nIt was the worse pizza and pasta I’ve had in my life. I don’t even know how this restaurant is not closed yet. \nThe pasta is fake. It was actually stirred fried instant noodles . It tasted so terrible.\nIt supposed to be seafood pasta but there wasn’t any seafood. Only leftover tails of the prawns which are inedible \nThe pizza was cold and tasteless\nThe worst is the service\nVery amateur and rude\nI will never comeback here again\nI rarely left negative reviews in the page but i thought i should let others know to avoid such a terrible experience happened to me\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 1, 2018",
